<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Montana</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Montana, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value for residential and builder work to handleless German luxury for high-end Big Sky mountain homes. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships.</p>

