<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint, stains, and a wide range of wood species; the versatile, high-margin choice for Montana's rustic-modern and mountain kitchens.</li>
