<h2 id="montana-market-opportunity">The Montana Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Montana's kitchen market is anchored by a powerful high-end mountain-modern movement around Bozeman and Big Sky, alongside steady residential demand in Billings, Missoula, and the Flathead Valley. Kitchens here are defined by mountain-modern luxury: warm woods like knotty alder and rift oak, reclaimed textures, blackened metal, and clean lines that frame big mountain views. The Bozeman and Big Sky market in particular has drawn an influx of high-end residents who want contemporary cabinetry with natural warmth — a high-margin opportunity for dealers pairing <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh's</a> stain and paint program with <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> or handleless fronts for a refined, modern-rustic result.</p>

